                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bbb56d7c-da34-35b4-a393-f153382e4c2f",
                        "entry_id": "963133bf-201d-342a-b1ab-58f82c98e0d6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "книжн. не существующий в действительности"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ffd4f570-39d4-43ec-a2c1-9502697f586d",
                        "source_entry_id": "963133bf-201d-342a-b1ab-58f82c98e0d6",
                        "source_sense_id": "bbb56d7c-da34-35b4-a393-f153382e4c2f",
                        "target_lang_word": "irreal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irreal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "22c93dfc-3a5d-30ab-bd0c-e869f3e27d29",
                                        "entry_id": "f387d087-69be-388d-bb23-0421d0fd97fb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Synonym of intangible, immaterial, not composed of things, having no concrete existence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b6ad2e71-ca1c-496c-a116-8e1905d3bb28",
                                                "sense_id": "22c93dfc-3a5d-30ab-bd0c-e869f3e27d29",
                                                "text": "'Irreal' objects draw on our previous sensual experience but have never existed; they are created through the spontaneous intentional operations of the imagination."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "184b7f15-990d-40f2-afd6-4f9119362cbd",
                                                "sense_id": "22c93dfc-3a5d-30ab-bd0c-e869f3e27d29",
                                                "text": "It is a shift to the ego conceived as irreal, as non-worldly."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f60dbf5-d856-45a9-b317-cb16ca281e5b",
                                                "sense_id": "22c93dfc-3a5d-30ab-bd0c-e869f3e27d29",
                                                "text": "The irreal spatiality of school dining rooms, including such things as décor, furnishings, modes of ordering, manner of queuing, ambience, 'feel', can also, as we have seen, actively limit these governmental ambitions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "291ca64c-f993-4d77-9e42-fdaf71b4d3e0",
                                                "sense_id": "22c93dfc-3a5d-30ab-bd0c-e869f3e27d29",
                                                "text": "It is impossible to directly access the imaginations of others, to know precisely if and how an imagined 'irreal' future is felt by an individual or shared by a 'collective', or to know if one has shared it oneself."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7f07c4c5-4df8-416b-a86e-1a32d77464db",
                        "source_entry_id": "963133bf-201d-342a-b1ab-58f82c98e0d6",
                        "source_sense_id": "bbb56d7c-da34-35b4-a393-f153382e4c2f",
                        "target_lang_word": "unreal",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "unreal",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e8dbf2fd-5ae0-355f-9ec8-a2d763c3c63d",
                                        "entry_id": "d56a2854-57b6-3280-b3bb-9160b0281e5e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Not real or substantial; having no actual presence in reality; lacking the characteristics of reality."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c25e040-060b-4d76-b39a-70323de3bce0",
                                                "sense_id": "e8dbf2fd-5ae0-355f-9ec8-a2d763c3c63d",
                                                "text": "The word ‘ivory’ rang in the air, was whispered, was sighed. You would think they were praying to it. A taint of imbecile rapacity blew through it all, like a whiff from some corpse. By Jove! I’ve never seen anything so unreal in my life."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a504765b-7056-47bb-8078-c4920a39728e",
                                                "sense_id": "e8dbf2fd-5ae0-355f-9ec8-a2d763c3c63d",
                                                "text": "\"The Boy's Uncle made me Real,\" he said. \"That was a great many years ago; but once you are Real you can't become unreal again. It lasts for always.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                        "entry_id": "d56a2854-57b6-3280-b3bb-9160b0281e5e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "very impressive; amazing; unbelievable; incredible; larger or more fantastic than typical of real life."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6674e99-12ea-46c7-bbea-0e9e99150479",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "The video includes unreal footage of an eight-metre wave."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ca76c9d-177e-40dc-8e60-642f1dd41259",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "I just had an unreal hamburger."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf692e34-d7a1-4971-a9b2-3e68e3ebc514",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "He stops his cab at every traffic light, unrolls his window and calls out to the other drivers: \"I've got a movie star in the car! Follow me down to see her come out. She is unreal, man! I am in seventh heaven! I have a dream!\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "94e9e63e-3181-4536-9177-cab462300051",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "\"She just set me up\" \"Now that's unreal, man. I mean, we're talking about a fairly considerable sum here, aren't we, Dexter?\" \"Listen to me. She set me up, with a dude she was cheatin' on me with"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b2004dd9-f4a8-4715-8b9d-e3703f1e0ecc",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "“Yeah, she does have a certain mental toughness that is unreal,” agreed Berto. “I really don't think of her as a girl, I mean, it's like she's a tough buddy or tough sister to me.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b580f5c5-8b2b-4b88-8330-b331125c646d",
                                                "sense_id": "fde87b79-a953-399a-a05f-fdea2df20890",
                                                "text": "He walks around and tries to pluck a flower on the ground. david exclaims, “Holy shit, this is unreal! i can feel the flower, the heat from the sun, and i can even hear the wind! The smells are so vibrant! How could i possibly be smelling flowers?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c70458fc-f745-4c9a-a76e-293a7921aa7d",
                        "source_entry_id": "963133bf-201d-342a-b1ab-58f82c98e0d6",
                        "source_sense_id": "bbb56d7c-da34-35b4-a393-f153382e4c2f",
                        "target_lang_word": "irreal",
                        "target_lang_code": "es",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "irreal",
                                "target_lang_code": "es",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b1a99b31-0ddb-3535-b373-f3ca25117568",
                                        "entry_id": "3d84d347-55d8-3327-b443-69d9a713b540",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Que no es real, que carece de las características de la realidad"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8f4c443-e8d1-4fbd-879c-30641a3c6804",
                                                "sense_id": "b1a99b31-0ddb-3535-b373-f3ca25117568",
                                                "text": "Y como nunca la había visto ni había oído nunca su voz, cuanto había visto y oído hasta entonces se me antojaba irreal, ficticio, inexistente"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "bed3189e-c7be-4a73-a754-e5da03428814",
                        "source_entry_id": "963133bf-201d-342a-b1ab-58f82c98e0d6",
